{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03325",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.77,
      "end_seconds": 6.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "doctor, I've brought them through. The observations are done, whenever you need them"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.78,
      "end_seconds": 13.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "Great. Hello, come in and sit down. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 17.32,
      "end_seconds": 27.74,
      "duration_seconds": 10.42,
      "text": "good morning, doctor. I came along to help out. We came because of a pearly bump on my nose that bleeds"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.25,
      "end_seconds": 32.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "so, what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.95,
      "end_seconds": 37.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "I've had it for about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.57,
      "end_seconds": 44.89,
      "duration_seconds": 6.32,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 44.99,
      "end_seconds": 49.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.36,
      "end_seconds": 57.81,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "I was getting to that! I've had crusting too, for about a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 59.65,
      "end_seconds": 67.38,
      "duration_seconds": 7.73,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Saturation 97 percent, pressure 109 over 81. Pulse 72, temperature is 36.5 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.02,
      "end_seconds": 68.92,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.42,
      "end_seconds": 73.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.56,
      "end_seconds": 77.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "fine by me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.23,
      "end_seconds": 80.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.8,
      "end_seconds": 104.55,
      "duration_seconds": 7.75,
      "text": "There is a pearly nodule with fine surface vessels and a central dip on the side of the nose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.42,
      "end_seconds": 112.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Please sit back down. Nothing like swollen glands?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.33,
      "end_seconds": 116.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Not at all, no swollen glands."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.6,
      "end_seconds": 124.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "and what about family history of skin cancer, pain or other new lumps?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.91,
      "end_seconds": 143.75,
      "duration_seconds": 15.84,
      "text": "Erm, no, no family history of skin cancer, no pain, no other new lumps. I did have a sore that won't heal at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.44,
      "end_seconds": 148.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.16,
      "end_seconds": 152.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.97,
      "end_seconds": 157.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.7,
      "end_seconds": 170.87,
      "duration_seconds": 12.17,
      "text": "I've had thin bones for five years now. I've got high cholesterol. Heart failure, for about a year. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.83,
      "end_seconds": 181.53,
      "duration_seconds": 8.7,
      "text": "understood yes, high cholesterol is known to us, good to have that clear have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.61,
      "end_seconds": 188.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "No, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.14,
      "end_seconds": 190.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.52,
      "end_seconds": 194.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "nothing, I haven't had any operations"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.33,
      "end_seconds": 197.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "what's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.81,
      "end_seconds": 206.91,
      "duration_seconds": 8.1,
      "text": "it's a... um, uh, I can't remember what it's called. It's a little pink tablet"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.89,
      "end_seconds": 210.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.49,
      "end_seconds": 226.39,
      "duration_seconds": 13.9,
      "text": "For my bones, I believe. My wife sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given. I take simvastatin, 20 milligrams, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 226.93,
      "end_seconds": 232.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 40 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.18,
      "end_seconds": 242.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.65,
      "text": "okay. Have you got the newest prescription or the box with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.79,
      "end_seconds": 247.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "I don't think I have it with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.24,
      "end_seconds": 269.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "Let's talk a a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.72,
      "end_seconds": 281.75,
      "duration_seconds": 12.03,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal. I smoke roughly a pack every two days. Not much, I mostly stay in these days. I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.66,
      "end_seconds": 292.18,
      "duration_seconds": 8.52,
      "text": "okay, thinking it through, my working impression is a likely basal cell carcinoma. We shouldn't forget a squamous cell carcinoma"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.4,
      "end_seconds": 318.17,
      "duration_seconds": 12.77,
      "text": "I think the skin cancer clinic should see you too. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.82,
      "end_seconds": 323.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.81,
      "end_seconds": 332.58,
      "duration_seconds": 6.77,
      "text": "Book a review after the biopsy. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 335.24,
      "end_seconds": 339.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "good, you know, thanks, I'll see you then"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.68,
      "end_seconds": 341.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}